{"unit_id":"tag:04I9:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n在图示中，有时将 <MATH_0001> 表示如下：<MATH_0002>。注意，由于 <MATH_0003> 伴随（adjoint）于 <MATH_0004>，且 <MATH_0005> 伴随（adjoint）于 <MATH_0006>，可见 <MATH_0007> 也诱导函子（functors）的变换（transformation）<MATH_0008>（通常用同一符号表示），它由图式（diagram）<MATH_0009> 交换（commutes）这一条件唯一刻画。由于集合（set）论上的困难（见注记 <REF_0001>），不能得到拓扑斯（topoi）的 2-范畴（2-category）。但仍可定义水平（horizontal）复合与垂直复合（vertical composition），并证明严格（strict）2-范畴（2-category）的公理——列于范畴（Categories）章第 <REF_0002> 节——成立。具体而言，2-态射（2-morphisms）的垂直复合（vertical composition）是明确的（只需复合函子（functors）的变换（transformations）），1-态射（1-morphisms）的复合（composition）已在定义 <REF_0003> 中给出，而 <MATH_0010> 的水平复合（horizontal composition）由函子（functors）的变换（transformation）<MATH_0011> 定义，它引入于范畴（Categories）章定义 <REF_0004>。明确地，<MATH_0012> 由以下给出：\n<MATHSEG_0001>或<MATHSEG_0002>\n（这些映射（maps）相等）。由于这些定义与范畴（Categories）章第 <REF_0005> 节中的定义一致，由范畴（Categories）章引理 <REF_0006> 可得：按这些定义，严格（strict）2-范畴（2-category）的公理成立。\n\n\n\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随"},{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"transformation","target_term":"变换"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图式"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"2-category","target_term":"2-范畴"},{"source_term":"horizontal","target_term":"水平"},{"source_term":"vertical composition","target_term":"垂直复合"},{"source_term":"strict","target_term":"严格"},{"source_term":"2-category","target_term":"2-范畴"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"2-morphisms","target_term":"2-态射"},{"source_term":"vertical composition","target_term":"垂直复合"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"transformations","target_term":"变换"},{"source_term":"1-morphisms","target_term":"1-态射"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"horizontal compos